<title>INDIA: India's Finolex 96/97 1st half net down.</title>
<headline>India's Finolex 96/97 1st half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 185.5   vs     279.7</p>
<p>    Sales	    1,934.5   vs   2,333.9</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)   20.5   vs	30.9</p>
<p>    Other income	87.6   vs     184.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure    1,572.3   vs   1,946.9</p>
<p>    Interest	   111.9   vs	81.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	78.0   vs	66.0</p>
<p>    Tax		   74.4   vs     144.9</p>
<p>Note: Telecom cable maker Finolex Cables said the results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
